%N A386833 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(3*n+1,k) * binomial(3*n-k-1,n-k).
%F A386833 a(n) = [x^n] (1+x)^(3*n+1)/(1-x)^(2*n).
%F A386833 a(n) = [x^n] 1/((1-x)^2 * (1-2*x)^(2*n)).
%F A386833 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 2^k * (-1)^(n-k) * (n-k+1) * binomial(3*n+1,k).
%F A386833 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 2^k * (n-k+1) * binomial(2*n+k-1,k).
%F A386833 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence n*(2*n-1)*a(n) +(-59*n^2+131*n-78)*a(n-1) +3*(90*n^2-149*n-124)*a(n-2) +3*(793*n^2-5995*n+10510)*a(n-3) +288*-(3*n-8)*(3*n-10)*a(n-4)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%F A386833 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence n*(n-2)*(2*n-1)*(5*n-6) *a(n) +(-145*n^4+594*n^3-806*n^2+405*n-54) *a(n-1) +3*(n-1)*(3*n-4)*(3*n-2)*(5*n-1)*a(n-2)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A386833 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(3*n+1, k)*binomial(3*n-k-1, n-k));
